<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>House Inventory System - User Guide</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>How to Remove an Item</h1>
    <p>This section walks users through removing an item no longer needed in the house inventory.</p>

    <h2>Steps to Remove the Item</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Launch the application</li>
        <li>
            Locate the item you would like to remove.
            <img src="/remove_item1.png"
                 alt="Item located to remove"
                 style="width:500px; height: 600px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
        <li>
            Once the item is highlighted you should find the 'Remove Item' button.
            <img src="/remove_item2.png"
                 alt="Highlighting item to remove"
                 style="width:500px; height: 600px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
        <li>
            After you have selected the 'Remove Item' button, you should check the inventory list and verify the item is removed.
            <img src="/remove_item3.png"
                 alt="Check item is removed"
                 style="width:500px; height: 600px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
    </ol>
</body>
</html>